<title>USA: Xerox files shelf for $1.015 bln debt.</title>
<headline>Xerox files shelf for $1.015 bln debt.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Xerox Corp filed Tuesday a shelf registration with the Securities and Exchange Commissin for up to $1.015 billion in debt securities.</p>
<p>When combined with previous registrations, the company said it will have up to $1.2 billion in debt securities available for sale.</p>
<p>It said net proceeds will be used for general corporate purposes.</p>
</text>
